  "stem": "A right circular cone has a base radius of \\(6\\) and a height of \\(7\\). The volume of the cone is \\(k\\pi\\). What is the value of \\(k\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "84"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(V = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^{2}h = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi(6^{2})(7)\\).",
    "\\(\\frac{1}{3}(36)(7) = 84\\), so \\(k = 84\\)."
  ],
